(   - `df.dropna\(how='any'\)`: Drops rows if any channel has missing data.) Tj
T*
(   - `df.dropna\(subset=['critical_channel']\)`: Drops only when key telemetry is lost.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Imputation Techniques:) Tj
T*
(   - Constant Filling: `df.fillna\(0.0\)`) Tj
T*
(   - Forward Fill \(`ffill`\): Propagates the last valid measured reading forward in time, matching) Tj
T*
(   physical sample-and-hold circuit behavior: `df.ffill\(\)`.) Tj
T*
(   - Backward Fill \(`bfill`\): Propagates the next valid future sample backward: `df.bfill\(\)`.) Tj
T*
(   - Polynomial and Spline Interpolation:) Tj
T*
(   `df['voltage'].interpolate\(method='time'\)` fits smooth mathematical curves across missing) Tj
T*
(   timestamps.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
